160
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:05,500
They fled

161
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:09,060
Their throats were slashed open in a heartbeat

162
00:11:09,060 --> 00:11:12,100
Back then I was thin

163
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:13,860
I wasn't eating nearly enough

164
00:11:13,860 --> 00:11:15,940
I was also quite timid

165
00:11:15,940 --> 00:11:18,060
Now that I think about it

166
00:11:18,060 --> 00:11:22,000
I had never so much as raised my voice

167
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:24,020
In summation

168
00:11:24,020 --> 00:11:26,520
I was but an unarmed blind man

169
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:28,940
I was hardly an intimidating presence

170
00:11:28,940 --> 00:11:31,520
So it's no wonder the kids chose to run

171
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:34,880
