Ah

200
00:12:25,820 --> 00:12:35,680
Striking a living creature in such a violent manner felt like hell to me.

201
00:12:36,780 --> 00:12:41,080
I'll never forget how revolting that feeling was for as long as I live.

202
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:47,240
For the first time in my life, I was clenching my fist to throw punches with full force,

203
00:12:47,680 --> 00:12:50,280
and my strength was terrifying even to me.

204
00:12:50,280 --> 00:12:58,620
Had that demon not attacked me, I would have gone my whole life never knowing how fearsome a strength I possessed.

205
00:12:59,900 --> 00:13:06,220
Again and again I continued to slam my fists against the demon's head until daybreak.

206
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:12,960
That night, I lost nearly everything, and my body was left broken.

207
00:13:14,020 --> 00:13:17,280
I had risked my life to protect little Sayo.

208
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:22,760
When help arrived on the scene, this is what she told them.

209
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:25,800
That man is a monster.

210
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,960
He's the one who did it.

211
00:13:28,460 --> 00:13:29,960
Who killed everyone.

212
00:13:31,780 --> 00:13:32,940
No way.

213
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:36,940
The terror of that experience must have left her confused.

214
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:39,860
She was just a child of four after all.

215
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:41,720
Who could blame her for it?

216
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:44,860
That's just the kind of creatures children are.

217
00:13:44,860 --> 00:13:49,040
Despite what happened, I was desperate.

218
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:52,240
I needed Sayo to appreciate what I had done.

219
00:13:53,380 --> 00:13:56,780
What I wanted to hear her say above all else was,

220
00:13:57,740 --> 00:14:00,360
Thank you for fighting for me.

221
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:06,560
I felt just hearing those words would have been enough to save me.

222
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:09,160
But these are children we're talking about.

223
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:11,780
All they can do is think of themselves.

224
00:14:12,880 --> 00:14:15,660
The demon's corpse soon turned to dust and vanished.

225
00:14:16,220 --> 00:14:19,360
All that remained were the bodies of the orphans I cared for.

226
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:24,660
Soon after the incident transpired, I was thrown into prison for murder.

227
00:14:25,660 --> 00:14:30,800
If the Master hadn't intervened on my behalf, I would have been executed at some point.

228
00:14:31,660 --> 00:14:36,220
It's because of what happened that I became distrustful of nearly everyone around me.

229
00:14:37,580 --> 00:14:39,980
Needless to say, I was suspicious of you too.

230
00:14:39,980 --> 00:14:46,560
Even the people who present themselves as being virtuous can turn against you when it matters most.

231
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:49,900
But you, you never ran off.

232
00:14:50,460 --> 00:14:52,020
You never turned your gaze away.

233
00:14:52,700 --> 00:14:53,500
You never lied.

234
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,620
You were pure and single-minded.

235
00:14:56,580 --> 00:14:58,700
And while that may seem simple enough,

236
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:02,780
few can remain that way regardless of the situation they're in.

237
00:15:02,780 --> 00:15:06,380
You're a special child, Tanjiro Kamado.

238
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:11,740
I say this as someone who's observed scores of people with the eyes of my soul.

239
00:15:12,380 --> 00:15:14,160
Thus, I cannot be wrong.

240
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:25,200
When it comes to what lies ahead, all of us hold our own doubts.

241
00:15:26,260 --> 00:15:28,400
From now on, I too will help you.

242
00:15:28,940 --> 00:15:31,980
However I can, to guide you along your path.

243
00:15:32,780 --> 00:15:39,160
I'll do my best.

244
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,700
Thank you for everything.

245
00:15:41,700 --> 00:16:04,080
All your training here with me is now complete.

246
00:16:05,740 --> 00:16:07,520
Your efforts have borne fruit.

247
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:27,360
Say what you will about him, but Mr. Himejima's a good guy.

248
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:33,520
He said I couldn't be his Tsukuko because I didn't have the talent.

249
00:16:34,080 --> 00:16:37,640
But when he sensed I was eating demons, he made me his apprentice.

250
00:16:39,580 --> 00:16:43,540
He even introduced me to Miss Kocho and had her check on my condition.

251
00:16:44,620 --> 00:16:45,040
Wow!

252
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:46,360
I had no idea!

253
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:49,300
Miss Kocho gave me this really sour look, though.

254
00:16:49,300 --> 00:16:51,640
And lectures me whenever I see her.

255
00:16:53,640 --> 00:16:55,640
Hey, wait!

256
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:58,280
We were saving that one for Zenitsu to eat.

257
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,000
Huh?

258
00:16:59,420 --> 00:17:02,060
If he's a no-show, that means he doesn't want it, right?

259
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,140
Know what I think?

260
00:17:03,320 --> 00:17:05,560
That jerk's probably got the runs right now!

261
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:06,060
No.

262
00:17:06,060 --> 00:17:10,000
Actually, if it was anything, I'd say he would be starving.

263
00:17:11,100 --> 00:17:12,500
Give it a rest already!

264
00:17:12,900 --> 00:17:15,340
All you ever do is worry about other people!

265
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:20,220
You know, you seem to be pretty stubborn yourself, so I thought she'd give you a hard time.

266
00:17:20,820 --> 00:17:21,680
But she didn't.

267
00:17:21,860 --> 00:17:23,160
So why did you get a pass?

268
00:17:23,860 --> 00:17:28,720
Well, if I had no breathing techniques, I have a feeling I'd be in the same boat as you.

269
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:31,460
Oh, how are you physically, though?

270
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:35,820
Knowing Miss Shinobu, she's only doing it because she's worried about your health.

271
00:17:36,420 --> 00:17:37,440
I think so.

272
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:38,640
Definitely.

273
00:17:39,780 --> 00:17:42,580
After I'm done eating, I'm going to Mr. Giyu's.

274
00:17:42,900 --> 00:17:43,960
Are you coming along, too?

275
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:45,940
Sorry, but I can't.

276
00:17:46,180 --> 00:17:48,820
I haven't been able to move my boulder at Cho yet.

277
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:49,420
Yeah!

278
00:17:49,660 --> 00:17:51,140
Well, I'm almost done, you know!

279
00:17:51,140 --> 00:17:53,940
That's just because I can't use breathing techniques.

280
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:58,300
You really can't use breathing techniques?

281
00:17:58,500 --> 00:17:59,380
What a loser!

282
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:01,020
What did you just call me?

283
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:01,740
Bottom feet!

284
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:02,220
Damn you!

285
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,540
It calms out, you two!

286
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:07,740
Get off!

287
00:18:10,540 --> 00:18:14,300
I was thinking maybe we could talk along the way if you were coming with me.

288
00:18:14,720 --> 00:18:15,660
About what?

289
00:18:16,100 --> 00:18:17,160
About the wind, Hashira.

290
00:18:17,800 --> 00:18:19,220
You know, about your older brother.

291
00:18:21,140 --> 00:18:22,580
I've been thinking.

292
00:18:34,260 --> 00:18:34,860
Hey!

293
00:18:35,420 --> 00:18:35,860
Zenitsu!

294
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:37,160
There you are!

295
00:18:38,220 --> 00:18:40,120
Did you ever get your boulder to move?

296
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:43,400
No, not yet.

297
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:45,220
I see.

298
00:18:46,180 --> 00:18:48,480
Well, I'm heading to my next training session.

299
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:49,800
Are you alright?

300
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:53,900
It's just, you haven't said very much over the last few days.

301
00:18:55,040 --> 00:18:56,100
Is that right?

302
00:18:56,980 --> 00:18:57,720
That's great.

303
00:18:58,720 --> 00:18:59,580
Give it your all.

304
00:18:59,580 --> 00:19:10,800
As for me, it's clear now, what I have to do, no matter what stands before me.

305
00:19:12,180 --> 00:19:13,620
Hey, did something happen?

306
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:16,420
If there's anything I can do to help…

307
00:19:16,420 --> 00:19:16,860
Tanjiro.

308
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:21,640
Just focus on what you need to do.

309
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:37,940
You really are a good person, aren't you, Tanjiro?

310
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:39,640
Thank you.

311
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:51,920
However, no matter what it may take, this is something I have to do.

312
00:19:51,920 --> 00:20:09,360
Is Zenitsu really going to be okay?

313
00:20:13,360 --> 00:20:14,420
Not to mention Nezuko.

314
00:20:14,420 --> 00:20:14,920
Wow.

315
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:17,420
I feel bad leaving her with someone else for so long.

316
00:20:17,420 --> 00:20:19,420
Wah-haa!

317
00:20:20,420 --> 00:20:22,420
I hope she's not feeling lonely.

318
00:20:24,220 --> 00:20:24,720
Huh?

319
00:20:25,120 --> 00:20:27,720
Let's see, so, right now, I'm here?

320
00:20:28,420 --> 00:20:31,620
Then Mr. Giyu's place should be close by, right?

321
00:20:44,420 --> 00:20:44,920
What?

322
00:21:01,420 --> 00:21:02,420
Wind breathing!

323
00:21:02,620 --> 00:21:03,500
First four!

324
00:21:04,220 --> 00:21:05,540
Dust whirlwind cutter!

325
00:21:06,220 --> 00:21:06,600
Hold on…

326
00:21:11,880 --> 00:21:12,500
I can see!

327
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:14,240
And follow their move!

328
00:21:14,420 --> 00:21:25,420
What's wrong? Come on! What happened to all that talk about not being like the rest of us, huh?

329
00:21:25,420 --> 00:21:28,420
It's just I'm not like the rest of you.

330
00:21:28,420 --> 00:21:31,420
Oh, about that. That's not what he meant.

331
00:21:31,420 --> 00:21:37,420
Water breathing. Fourth form. Strike and tide.

332
00:21:37,420 --> 00:21:39,420
You're too slow!

333
00:21:39,420 --> 00:21:44,420
Seventh form. Drop ripple thrust.

334
00:21:44,420 --> 00:21:48,420
Fifth form! Gold Mountain Wind!

335
00:21:53,420 --> 00:21:57,420
Fine. Guess we'll kill each other with our bare hands then!

336
00:21:57,420 --> 00:22:03,420
Wait, wait, wait! Please wait a second! You can't just kill each other!

337
00:22:03,420 --> 00:22:08,420
Tell me a favor and shut the hell up! And what happened to that restraining order you have?

338
00:22:08,420 --> 00:22:12,420
Oh, I get it. You've been spying on us, you lousy scumbag!

339
00:22:12,420 --> 00:22:19,420
Is this about red bean mochi? If that's the case, I promise I can make you enough to fill you up, okay?

340
00:22:19,420 --> 00:22:22,420
You're messing with me, aren't you, brat?

341
00:22:22,420 --> 00:22:25,420
What? No, no, I'm serious!

342
00:22:25,420 --> 00:22:28,420
After all, you do love red bean mochi, right?

343
00:22:28,420 --> 00:22:31,420
I remember back when you were training me at your place.

344
00:22:31,420 --> 00:22:35,420
I could always count on catching a whiff of mochi rice and red bean paste.

345
00:22:35,420 --> 00:22:37,420
Smells so good!

346
00:22:37,420 --> 00:22:46,420
There was always this lovely scent of matcha tea and red bean mochi, so I thought...

347
00:22:46,420 --> 00:22:51,420
Hey, Shinazugawa. You like red bean mochi?

348
00:22:51,420 --> 00:22:54,420
Red bean mochis sure are yummy, aren't they?

349
00:22:54,420 --> 00:22:56,420
Do you like smooth beans or chunky?

350
00:22:56,420 --> 00:23:00,420
My grandma's red bean mochi was my favorite!

351
00:23:08,420 --> 00:23:13,420
What the? Huh? Mr. Giyu?

352
00:23:13,420 --> 00:23:17,420
Shinazugawa left. He got frustrated and stormed off.

353
00:23:17,420 --> 00:23:22,420
Oh, I see. So why were you two fighting?

354
00:23:22,420 --> 00:23:26,420
We weren't fighting. It's just part of Hashira training.

355
00:23:26,420 --> 00:23:29,420
We spar with each other. Hashira versus Hashira.

356
00:23:29,420 --> 00:23:38,420
Wow, I had no idea. That's why you used wooden swords. It was sparring. Oh, I get it now.

357
00:23:38,420 --> 00:23:40,420
Sorry I interrupted.

358
00:23:40,420 --> 00:23:52,420
Well, don't worry about it. You hardly interrupted anything. We barely talked, and he was angry the whole time. But I found out what Shinazugawa's favorite food is.

359
00:23:52,420 --> 00:23:58,420
From now on I think I'll hide a red bean mochi in my sleeve. And every time I see him, give him one.

360
00:23:58,420 --> 00:24:01,420
Hey! That's a great idea!

361
00:24:01,420 --> 00:24:04,420
If I do, maybe then we'll become friends.

362
00:24:04,420 --> 00:24:06,420
I'll do the same!

363
00:24:06,420 --> 00:24:09,420
Yeah, don't bother, idiots.

364
00:24:13,420 --> 00:24:23,420
Bastards. Where'd they go off to anyway? They can't be out. Iguro and Tokido at the same time?

365
00:24:23,420 --> 00:24:28,420
If running those losers into the ground is all I do, I'll get rusty.

366
00:24:28,420 --> 00:24:30,420
Is this about red bean mochi?

367
00:24:31,420 --> 00:24:36,420
Tanjiro Kamado. If only that punk hadn't put a damper on things.

368
00:24:37,420 --> 00:24:38,420
Bastard!

369
00:24:39,420 --> 00:24:45,420
What the hell's his deal anyway? All he does is get in my way, stupid brat!

